  m_Name: IntroPage_03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroPageData
  pageTitle: The New Cities
  pageBody: 'The rich moved far away from the Junkyards and built new cities behind
    high walls.


    The poor had no such choice. They lived near the ruins, close
    enough to hear the machines still moving beneath the broken ground.'
